{"seq":2,"slug":"ballistic-missiles","title":"弹道导弹与防御系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles","wordCount":1260,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"弹道导弹与防御系统\">弹道导弹与防御系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>弹道导弹是核威慑的主要载体，也是大国战略博弈的核心要素。从 1944 年德国 V-2 火箭到当今的洲际弹道导弹（ICBM），弹道导弹技术经历了近 80 年发展，形成从短程到洲际、从液体到固体、从单弹头到分导式多弹头的完整谱系。与之对应，弹道导弹防御系统也从「星球大战」构想走到了多层防御的实战部署。</p>\n<p>理解弹道攻防的钥匙是一对「矛与盾」：进攻方靠多弹头、诱饵、机动弹头突防，防御方靠助推段-中段-末段三层拦截应对。两者的技术竞赛深刻影响全球战略稳定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    BOOST[&quot;助推段&lt;br/&gt;3-5 分钟·红外强&quot;] --&gt; MID[&quot;中段&lt;br/&gt;20-25 分钟·真空弹道&quot;]&#10;    MID --&gt; TERM[&quot;末段&lt;br/&gt;1-2 分钟·Mach 20+&quot;]&#10;    BOOST -.对应拦截.-&gt; I1[&quot;激光/动能(窗口极短)&quot;]&#10;    MID -.对应拦截.-&gt; I2[&quot;GMD(难辨诱饵)&quot;]&#10;    TERM -.对应拦截.-&gt; I3[&quot;THAAD/PAC-3&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    BOOST[\"助推段&lt;br/&gt;3-5 分钟·红外强\"] --&gt; MID[\"中段&lt;br/&gt;20-25 分钟·真空弹道\"]\n    MID --&gt; TERM[\"末段&lt;br/&gt;1-2 分钟·Mach 20+\"]\n    BOOST -.对应拦截.-&gt; I1[\"激光/动能(窗口极短)\"]\n    MID -.对应拦截.-&gt; I2[\"GMD(难辨诱饵)\"]\n    TERM -.对应拦截.-&gt; I3[\"THAAD/PAC-3\"]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"弹道导弹分类与三段飞行\">弹道导弹分类与三段飞行</h3><p>弹道导弹按射程分四类：SRBM（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1000\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、MRBM（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>3000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\text{–}3000\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、IRBM（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3000</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>5500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3000\\text{–}5500\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>）、ICBM（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;5500\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>）。飞行分助推段（约 3–5 分钟，红外信号最强）、中段（ICBM 约 20–25 分钟，远地点达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>1200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\text{–}1200\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>）和末段（再入速度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mach </mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mach}\\ 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mach</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 以上）。理想条件下射程为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\frac{v_0^2 \\sin(2\\theta_0)}{g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3715em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为关机速度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为关机角。实际 ICBM 关机速度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\,\\text{km/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，接近第一宇宙速度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"主要洲际弹道导弹对比\">主要洲际弹道导弹对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>型号</th>\n<th>国家</th>\n<th>射程</th>\n<th>弹头</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>「民兵」III LGM-30G</td>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>&gt;13,000 km</td>\n<td>3×W87（300kt）</td>\n<td>唯一现役陆基 ICBM，后继「哨兵」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RS-28「萨尔马特」</td>\n<td>俄罗斯</td>\n<td>&gt;18,000 km</td>\n<td>10–15 MIRV 或「先锋」HGV</td>\n<td>现役最大 ICBM，弹射冷发射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>「东风-41」DF-41</td>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>12,000–15,000 km</td>\n<td>6–10 MIRV</td>\n<td>固体燃料、公路/铁路机动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分导式多弹头-突防的利器\">分导式多弹头：突防的利器</h3><p>分导式多弹头（MIRV）使一枚导弹携带多个独立打击不同目标的弹头，由「母舱」（PBV）多次机动逐个释放。一枚携带 10 个弹头的 ICBM 意味着防御方需至少 10 次成功拦截（不含诱饵）——这是弹道导弹防御的主要挑战之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"弹道导弹防御-三层拦截\">弹道导弹防御：三层拦截</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拦截层</th>\n<th>时机/高度</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n<th>难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>助推段</td>\n<td>加速段 3–5 分钟</td>\n<td>激光、动能拦截器</td>\n<td>窗口极短、需抵近部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中段</td>\n<td>大气层外弹道段</td>\n<td>GMD（GBI/EKV）</td>\n<td>真空中难辨诱饵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末段</td>\n<td>再入后</td>\n<td>THAAD（40–150km）、PAC-3（15–40km）</td>\n<td>反应时间极短</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>中段拦截的最大挑战是目标识别——真空中轻质诱饵与重弹头沿相同弹道飞行难以区分。美国 GMD 拦截弹 GBI 携带的 EKV 通过直接碰撞（hit-to-kill）摧毁弹头，相对拦截速度超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km/s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\,\\text{km/s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km/s</span></span></span></span></span></span>。以色列「箭-3」在 2023 年首次实战中于外太空成功拦截弹道导弹。助推段拦截可借助 <a href=\"military-satellites\">天基红外预警</a> 和 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons\">定向能武器</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"战略稳定与军控\">战略稳定与军控</h3><p>弹道导弹与防御本质是「矛与盾」的战略博弈。新 START 条约限制美俄各部署不超过 1550 枚核弹头和 700 件运载工具，但条约到期和 <a href=\"hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速滑翔飞行器</a> 的出现正动摇既有军控框架（战略稳定的理论分析见 <a href=\"../../military-theory/\">军事理论</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2024–2026 年核心动态：美国 GMD 下一代拦截弹（NGI）加速研制，采用多杀伤飞行器技术；中国大规模扩建 ICBM 发射井群（据商业卫星图像约 300 个新建井），改变长期「最小核威慑」态势；朝鲜「火星-18」固体燃料 ICBM 成功试射标志核打击能力质变；SDA「跟踪层」太空层导弹防御传感器开始部署，弥补对高超声速目标的跟踪盲区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>弹道导弹防御系统能否从根本上改变核战略的「相互确保毁灭」（MAD）逻辑？完美的导弹防御是否反而会增加战争风险？</li>\n<li>分导式多弹头和诱饵技术为什么使中段拦截如此困难？有哪些技术途径可以解决目标识别问题？</li>\n<li>固体燃料 ICBM 相比液体燃料 ICBM 有何优势？这对战略预警和危机稳定性有何影响？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章姊妹篇：<a href=\"military-satellites\">军事卫星系统</a>（预警与跟踪）、<a href=\"hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a>（新型突防）。</li>\n<li>海基与空基核力量见 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/naval-weapon-systems\">海战武器装备</a>（SSBN）与 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/air-weapon-systems\">空战武器装备</a>（战略轰炸机）；助推段激光拦截见 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/directed-energy-weapons\">定向能武器</a>。</li>\n<li>核威慑与战略稳定的理论见 <a href=\"../../military-theory/\">军事理论</a>。</li>\n<li>本 hub 整体定位见 <a href=\"../\">军事技术学科简介</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>弹道导弹与防御系统的发展是大国战略博弈的技术缩影。ICBM 通过多弹头、机动弹头和高超声速滑翔飞行器不断增强突防；导弹防御从助推段到末段构建多层拦截。在可预见的未来，完全有效的导弹防御仍不可能，核威慑的「恐怖平衡」仍是大国关系的底层逻辑。把握「三段飞行对应三层拦截」这条主线，再看 <a href=\"hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a> 如何绕过中段拦截，便能理解当代战略攻防的最新前沿。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"弹道导弹与防御系统","id":"弹道导弹与防御系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"弹道导弹分类与三段飞行","id":"弹道导弹分类与三段飞行"},{"level":3,"text":"主要洲际弹道导弹对比","id":"主要洲际弹道导弹对比"},{"level":3,"text":"分导式多弹头：突防的利器","id":"分导式多弹头-突防的利器"},{"level":3,"text":"弹道导弹防御：三层拦截","id":"弹道导弹防御-三层拦截"},{"level":3,"text":"战略稳定与军控","id":"战略稳定与军控"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"军事卫星系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites"},"next":{"title":"高超声速武器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/hypersonic-weapons"}}